cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the papers it follows."
title: "ex_monty_cad"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ledentsov
    given-names: Dmitry
    website: "https://github.com/d-led"
repository-code: "https://github.com/d-led/ex.monty.cad"
license: MPL-2.0
version: "0.6.2"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
abstract: >-
  The join between an exact CAD part and Monty's own percept and library
  format: a sample of a B-rep's surface becomes the features a sensor module
  would report, and a part becomes the library a run loads.
keywords:
  - thousand brains
  - Monty
  - CAD
  - step
  - B-rep
  - sensorimotor
  - Elixir
# Zenodo mints a DOI for each GitHub release; add it as `doi:` once the first
# release has been archived.
references:
